od at Rs. 8,055.70 crores as against Rs. 6,026.43 crores in the same period of the previous year.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":31.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Standalone profit after tax increased by 59.79% year-on-year to Rs. 3,444.56 crores in Q1 FY27.","quote":"The profit after tax increased by 59.79 % and stood at Rs. 3,444.56 crores as against Rs. 2,155.73 crores recorded in the same period of the previous year.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":31.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The revised definition of wages under the New Labour Codes resulted in incremental employee benefit expenses for gratuity and compensated absences during the previous financial year.","quote":"Employee benefits expenses for the year ended March 31, 2026 include incremental impact on gratuity of Rs. 131.71 crores and on long-term compensated absences of Rs. 65.24 crores due to change in definition of wages under the New Labour Codes.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Shriram Finance had Rs. 33,021.82 crores in secured non-convertible debentures as of June 30, 2026, backed by hypothecation loan agreements and charges on immovable property.","quote":"The Company's secured non-convertible debentures of Rs. 33,021.82 crores as on June 30, 2026 are secured by specific assets covered under hypothecation loan agreements and by way of exclusive charge and mortgage of immovable property","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"MUFG Bank acquired a 20% equity stake on a fully diluted basis following the preferential issue of shares by Shriram Finance.","quote":"Pursuant to the allotment of equity shares, MUFG has become a minority public shareholder of the Company representing 20% equity stake on a fully diluted basis.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Transaction costs for two-wheeler loans are now amortized using the effective interest rate over the loan tenure rather than expensed upfront.","quote":"Consequent to the increase in the estimated Two-Wheeler portfolio, these transaction costs have been considered as a part of cash flows for estimation of effective interest rate (EIR) for loans granted from January 01, 2026.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"neutral","quote":"The Company continues to monitor the minimum wage rates from the Central Government as well as other aspects of the New Labour Codes and would provide appropriate accounting effect on the basis of such developments as required.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Shriram Finance increased its net interest margin to 9.04% in Q1 FY27 compared to 8.11% in the prior year period.","quote":"Our net interest margin in Q1 FY '27 was 9.04% as against 8.11% in Q1 FY '26 and 8.61% in Q4 FY '26.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company's leverage ratio dropped substantially following a capital infusion.","quote":"The leverage ratio came down because of this large capital infusion, is at 2.14x versus 3.82x as of March.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Gross Stage 3 assets increased slightly to 4.64% during the quarter.","quote":"On asset quality, gross Stage 3 in Q1 FY '27 stood at 4.64% and net Stage 3 at 2.33% as against 4.53% gross and 2.57% net in Q1 FY '26","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Management reaffirmed its full-year growth guidance of 18%.","quote":"Our earlier guidance of 18% will hold good unless after second quarter, we revise it.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Credit costs are projected to remain around 2% across the near and medium term.","quote":"Yes, I think it will hold good, but our -- see, our guidance has been around 2%. So it will remain around that in the near term or even in the medium term.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Shriram Finance plans to open approximately 150 new branches in FY27.","quote":"Tentatively around 150 branches.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":14.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company expects to achieve more than 15% growth in the next quarter before potentially accelerating.","quote":"But we are confident that we'll be able to grow more than 15% at least for next quarter. Then onwards, if things are much better, we feel that we'll be able to catch up and grow faster.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management targets doubling its gold loan book to 5% of total assets over three years.","quote":"So we expect the portfolio to grow double in the next 3 years from around 2.5% of the overall book to around 5% because we feel that there's a very big opportunity for us to grow in the gold.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Vehicle demand continues to be strong without indications of idling or customer stress.","quote":"And the demand for the vehicle remains good because we have not seen any stress or vehicle idling anywhere, and there has been good demand for the vehicle.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Rural markets are showing solid demand for used vehicles.","quote":"Even in used vehicle, the demand is quite good from the rural market. So I think it's a very comfortable journey.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The overall cost of liabilities decreased by 3 basis points, with incremental borrowings at 7.77%.","quote":"The cost of liability has also come down from 8.59% to 8.56%, 3 basis point reduction. The incremental cost is at 7.77%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Net interest margins are expected to stay near current levels for two quarters before settling around 8.5% in the medium term.","quote":"See, immediate 2 quarters, I think the current NIM will hold good because we are utilizing the capital. But over the medium term, definitely, it will come down a little because our new vehicle mix will go up.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Total liabilities decreased during the quarter as capital raised in April 2026 was utilized.","quote":"On the liability side, this quarter, we didn't borrow much and overall liabilities have come down from INR2,50,690 crores as of March to INR2,32,639 crores because of use of capital in the current quarter","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company has prepared 2,200 of its existing branches to provide gold loans.","quote":"And currently, around 2,200 branches are made ready for gold loan activity.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Commercial vehicle sales in India expanded 14.1% during the quarter following a GST rate reduction.","quote":"Commercial vehicle sales increased by 14.1% in Q1 FY '27 and stands at 2.65 lakh units as against 2.24 lakh units in the Q1 '26.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Monsoon deficits and erratic rainfall patterns pose downside risks to farm output, inflation, and spending.","quote":"A big monsoon deficit, a changing monsoon path, inconsistent rainfall could cause problems for agriculture, inflation and overall spending.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Uncertainty surrounding agricultural harvest volumes and rural income remains a primary concern.","quote":"Ultimately, there is a little uncertainty towards the output and the rural income. So that is the only challenge we would like to wait and see.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"And of course, there is added uncertainty of West Asia crisis. But we are very confident that the company will do well and we will come out with a good set of numbers.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":16.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[{"kpi":"AUM (Rs cr)","value":313798.39,"unit":"Rs cr","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":31},{"kpi":"AUM growth YoY %","value":15.26,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_24072026140729_OutcomeofBMNSEBSE.pdf","page":31},{"kpi":"Disbursements (Rs cr)","value":49974.49,"unit":"Rs cr","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":4},{"kpi":"AUM growth YoY %","value":15.26,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Mathew_27072026153856_BSENSE_Transcript_of_Earning_Call.pdf","page":4},{"kpi":"AUM (Rs cr)","value":313798.39,"unit":"Rs cr","doc_kind":"